  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6aac858ac489528ef266b0c1",
      "text": "黒崎真音",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789691276,
      "updated": 1789691276
    },
    {
      "id": "6aac858b00000000002234e0",
      "text": ">黒崎 真音（くろさき まおん、1988年〈昭和63年〉1月13日 - 2023年〈令和5年〉2月16日）は、日本の女性[歌手]。[東京都]出身。[ALTIMA]、[ALICes]のメンバー",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789691276,
      "updated": 1789691309
    },
    {
      "id": "6aac858f00000000002234e2",
      "text": "\t[https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/黒崎真音 黒崎真音]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789691280,
      "updated": 1789691329
    },
    {
      "id": "6aac85ed00000000002234e3",
      "text": "\t35歳没",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789691374,
      "updated": 1789691375
    },
    {
      "id": "6aac869a00000000002234ec",
      "text": "\t\t死因：持病の悪化",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789691547,
      "updated": 1789691561
    },
    {
      "id": "6aac972d0000000000af41fa",
      "text": "\t\t\t持病に関して詳細は非公表",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789695790,
      "updated": 1789695934
    },
    {
      "id": "6aac973f0000000000af41fb",
      "text": "\t\t\t2021年、[配信ライブ]中に倒れ[硬膜外血腫]による緊急手術を受けている",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789695808,
      "updated": 1789695864
    },
    {
      "id": "6aac862d00000000002234e5",
      "text": "\tALTIMA：",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789691438,
      "updated": 1789691446
    },
    {
      "id": "6aac866700000000002234e6",
      "text": "\t\tMAON（ボーカル）",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789691496,
      "updated": 1789691499
    },
    {
      "id": "6aac866d00000000002234e9",
      "text": "\t\t\t黒崎真音",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789691502,
      "updated": 1789691507
    },
    {
      "id": "6aac866a00000000002234e7",
      "text": "  [MOTSU]（[ラップ]）",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789691499,
      "updated": 1789695886
    },
    {
      "id": "6aac866a00000000002234e8",
      "text": "  [SAT]（[シンセサイザー]）",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789691499,
      "updated": 1789695883
    },
    {
      "id": "6aac867500000000002234ea",
      "text": "  \t[八木沼悟志]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789691511,
      "updated": 1789691540
    },
    {
      "id": "6aac858c00000000002234e1",
      "text": "\tALICes：[神田沙也加]との[ユニット]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789691277,
      "updated": 1789691426
    },
    {
      "id": "6aac860c00000000002234e4",
